      ],
      "content": "TL 01 SW         NETTLEDEN WITH         NETTLEDEN ROAD                  POTTEN END             (North side) 3/221                                   Milestone 750m to -                                       W of Church at                                         Nat Grid Ref TL 0133 1075 -                                       II Milestone at Grid Ref TL 0133  1075.  Early C19  for  7th Earl of Bridgewater. Portland stone. A small square milestone not connected with any turnpike, with figures cut into the stone. About 15ins square and 2ft high with chamfered corners and blunt pyramidal top. Inscribed on S face  '27/MILES/[TO/LONDON]'.  The  road forms  a distant  approach  to Ashridge mansion. Similar milestone in Little Gaddesden parish on same road, with full inscription. (Branch Johnson (1970) 111). Listing NGR: TL0133010750"
    }
